WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.018
Once upon a time, there lived a king with a beautiful daughter.

2
00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:15.847
She liked to play with her golden ball by the pond near the forest.

3
00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:21.618
One day the princess accidentally let the ball fall into the pond. Splash!

4
00:00:21.619 --> 00:00:25.059
"Oops! Oh no!" she cried.

5
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:30.938
She tried to find her ball in the pond, but the water was too deep.

6
00:00:30.939 --> 00:00:33.746
The princess began to cry very loudly.

7
00:00:33.747 --> 00:00:37.287
An ugly frog sitting on a rock by the pond heard her.

8
00:00:37.288 --> 00:00:41.771
"Boo-hoo-hoo! Now what will I do?

9
00:00:41.772 --> 00:00:45.483
I have lost my golden ball forever!" she said.

10
00:00:45.484 --> 00:00:51.741
"What is the matter, princess? Why are you crying?" the frog asked.

11
00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:58.301
"I am crying because my golden ball fell into the pond," she answered.

12
00:00:58.302 --> 00:01:02.724
"Do not cry. I can help you!" said the frog.

13
00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:07.373
"How can this ugly frog help me?" the princess wondered.

14
00:01:07.374 --> 00:01:09.401
The ugly frog paused.

15
00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:17.242
"Hmm. What will you give me for finding your golden ball?" he asked.

16
00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:21.778
"I will give you whatever you want, dear frog," the princess promised.

17
00:01:21.779 --> 00:01:23.584
"I will give you my jewels.

18
00:01:23.585 --> 00:01:27.559
I will even give you the golden crown I am wearing."

19
00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:32.919
"I do not want your jewels or your crown," answered the frog.

20
00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:40.512
"But promise me this: take me back to the castle and let me sit by you and eat with you.

21
00:01:40.513 --> 00:01:44.709
And you must kiss me too. Promise me!

22
00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:48.871
Then I will go down into the pond and get your ball."

23
00:01:48.872 --> 00:01:55.832
"Oh, if I must, yes! I promise you all that you wish," the princess consented.

24
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:57.461
"Now please hurry!"

25
00:01:57.462 --> 00:02:01.453
So the frog hopped into the pond and retrieved the golden ball.

26
00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.606
He tossed it onto the grass.

27
00:02:03.607 --> 00:02:08.185
The princess was very happy. "Oh, my golden ball!

28
00:02:08.186 --> 00:02:12.978
Thank you, frog!" she said. She picked up the ball and hurried away.

29
00:02:12.979 --> 00:02:17.489
"Wait, wait!" called the frog. "Take me with you!

30
00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:22.625
I cannot run as fast as you can."

31
00:02:22.626 --> 00:02:27.176
But the princess ignored him and hurried back to her castle and closed the door.

32
00:02:27.177 --> 00:02:31.957
"The frog is talking nonsense. The forest is the right place for a frog.

33
00:02:31.958 --> 00:02:35.980
Life in the castle is not for him!" she said to herself.

34
00:02:35.981 --> 00:02:39.738
The next day the frog hopped up to the castle door and knocked.

35
00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:48.944
"Oh, princess! Princess! Open the door for me."

36
00:02:48.945 --> 00:02:55.978
"Oh no! It is the ugly frog! Make him go away!" the princess told her servant.

37
00:02:55.979 --> 00:02:59.593
The servant went to the door and told the frog to leave immediately.

38
00:02:59.594 --> 00:03:04.416
She slammed the door in the poor frog's face, but the frog did not go away.

39
00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:12.752
"Princess, princess! Open the door for me. Keep the promise you made to me.

40
00:03:12.753 --> 00:03:22.525
If you don't open the door, I will cry here day and night until you do! Open the door!"

41
00:03:22.526 --> 00:03:25.743
The king noticed that his daughter was bothered by something.

42
00:03:25.744 --> 00:03:33.097
"My child, what are you afraid of? Is there something scary outside?" he asked.

43
00:03:33.098 --> 00:03:39.933
"No, it is nothing," she answered. "It is only a disgusting frog!"

44
00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:42.917
She then told her father how the frog had helped her.

45
00:03:42.918 --> 00:03:47.446
"Dear child, you must keep your promise to the frog.

46
00:03:47.447 --> 00:03:51.571
A promise is a promise. Go and let him in!"

47
00:03:51.572 --> 00:03:55.216
So the princess let him in, and they all sat down to eat.

48
00:03:55.217 --> 00:04:03.290
"Lift me up beside you, princess," the frog asked, but the princess didn't want to.

49
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:08.077
"Dear, a promise is a promise," said the king.

50
00:04:08.078 --> 00:04:12.458
"You should not make a promise if you do not intend to keep it."

51
00:04:12.459 --> 00:04:17.845
The princess did not want the frog near her, but she could not disobey her father.

52
00:04:17.846 --> 00:04:20.560
So she let the frog hop up beside her.

53
00:04:20.561 --> 00:04:24.788
"Now push your golden plate nearer to me.

54
00:04:24.789 --> 00:04:30.807
I am hungry and I want to eat with you," the frog said.

55
00:04:30.808 --> 00:04:38.360
The frog enjoyed all of the food, but the princess had no appetite because she did not like being near the ugly frog.

56
00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:44.395
After dinner the princess went to her room, but the frog insisted on following her.

57
00:04:44.396 --> 00:04:47.383
When she closed the door, he made his last demand.

58
00:04:47.384 --> 00:04:51.271
"Dear princess, it is time for you to kiss me!

59
00:04:51.272 --> 00:04:54.549
If you do not, I will tell your father!"

60
00:04:54.550 --> 00:05:00.363
"Oh! Nooo!" the princess protested.

61
00:05:00.364 --> 00:05:03.346
She grabbed the frog and threw him against the wall.

62
00:05:03.347 --> 00:05:06.583
"Now you will be quiet, you ugly frog!"

63
00:05:06.584 --> 00:05:11.345
"Ohh!" groaned the frog. Then it was very still.

64
00:05:11.346 --> 00:05:14.333
The princess quickly regretted what she had done.

65
00:05:14.334 --> 00:05:19.675
"Oh, is he dead? Oh my, what have I done!"

66
00:05:19.676 --> 00:05:25.048
She picked up the ugly frog very tenderly, but the frog still did not move.

67
00:05:25.049 --> 00:05:30.121
The princess felt very sorry for him.

68
00:05:30.122 --> 00:05:32.751
"He just wanted to be my friend.

69
00:05:32.752 --> 00:05:36.289
What have I done to this poor frog?" she said.

70
00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:38.696
And she kissed the frog as she cried.

71
00:05:38.697 --> 00:05:44.622
Suddenly with a bright flash of light, the ugly frog transformed into a handsome prince.

72
00:05:44.623 --> 00:05:48.075
"Wow! You broke the spell!" he said.

73
00:05:48.076 --> 00:05:55.342
"A long time ago, a wicked witch turned me into an ugly frog just because I did not like her.

74
00:05:55.343 --> 00:06:00.233
Only the kiss of a beautiful princess could save me. Thank you, dear princess!"

75
00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:02.989
The princess was overjoyed at the change.

76
00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:07.655
In no time at all, the prince and the princess fell in love and were married.

77
00:06:07.656 --> 00:06:10.778
And they lived happily ever after.
